{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act15side_level_act15side_02_end",
  "groupId": "act15side",
  "stageId": "act15side_02",
  "title": "無尋處",
  "storyCode": "IW-2",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act15side/level_act15side_02_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "dcbd96f76c6743e98feb0bdccc48a0881ea80ec2e8a80a94410e32b6f364f08e",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "2下"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“尚蜀山巒多棧道，峰迴路轉現長煙。”\n這塊標牌突兀地杵在這裡，標牌是新的，字是新的，只有標語是老的。\n而山是老的，石台階是老的，索道和人，又都是新的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "我摸了摸頭，髮梢並沒有像想像中那般濕成一團。無法言說的感覺正如醍醐灌頂，浸染身心。\n所有清晰的關於白天的記憶都在迅速遠去，可當你需要時，它們又會貼心地鑽回腦海。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "我決定向上走。\n我也不知道為什麼要向上走。哪怕我確信此刻左腳踩右腳就能觸碰天空，我也選擇了一步一個台階地向上走。\n就像是回應誠意一般，又一塊牌子出現在了棧道拐角。\n新的牌子，新的字，如同所有刻著到此一遊的景區標牌那樣。\n“攥江峰”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "攥江峰......這是哪裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "喂——有人嗎——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隱隱的回音",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "喂......有人嗎......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "......罷了，既來之則安之，既來之則安之。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "（......遠處好像有個亭子。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "（怪了，我怎麼記得在哪裡見過......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "掃雪的路人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_304_1",
      "text": "這個時間不常有人來的，你要去那個亭子那兒？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "啊，不是......只是看看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "這裡是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "掃雪的路人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_304_1",
      "text": "攥江峰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "尚蜀三山十七峰之一？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "掃雪的路人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_304_1",
      "text": "......是十八峰啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "掃雪的路人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_304_1",
      "text": "那個亭子路很不好走的，也不知道是誰那麼閒，在那兒建了個亭子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "......好像有人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "掃雪的路人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_304_1",
      "text": "有的啊，沒人要亭子做什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "你在這裡掃雪？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "掃雪的路人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_304_1",
      "text": "是啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "山頂沒什麼人吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "掃雪的路人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_304_1",
      "text": "掃了雪才有人來呀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "誰會來？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "掃雪的路人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_304_1",
      "text": "天知道，你不就來了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "掃雪的路人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_304_1",
      "text": "亭子裡的人是不是在向你招手？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "......有嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "掃雪的路人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_304_1",
      "text": "多留意腳下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "掃雪的路人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_304_1",
      "text": "雪天路滑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "text": "......都在這裡了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "街頭青年",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_305_1",
      "text": "是啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "街頭青年",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_305_1",
      "text": "師傅們不讓我們摻和，大掌櫃的又天天忙他的酒樓客棧，不想混吃等死的，都在這兒了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "軟弱的學徒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_303_1",
      "text": "真不需要聽鄭......鄭掌櫃的，退一步行事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "街頭青年",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_305_1",
      "text": "啊？聽他的？聽他的大家一起改行當廚師啦，還學什麼武藝？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "街頭青年",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_305_1",
      "text": "其他地方的物流公司，哪個不是風風火火的？大掌櫃寧可改行開餐廳都不樂意打破那些規矩和物流公司競爭，我看他是老糊塗了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "軟弱的學徒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_303_1",
      "text": "在鄭掌櫃眼裡，做餐飲生意也是正經買賣，可砸了招牌變成行裕物流，他是絕對不同意的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "街頭青年",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_305_1",
      "text": "你說為啥啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "軟弱的學徒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_303_1",
      "text": "你問我，我哪知道啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "text": "鄭老頭這些年有多怕事，你我心知肚明。幹鏢局這麼多年，臨老了才悟過來，一輩子光得罪人了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "text": "再這樣下去，沒人砸鏢局招牌，鏢局也一樣會完蛋。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "街頭青年",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_305_1",
      "text": "......但這次，是筆和朝廷有關的大生意來著？故意搞砸，會不會有問題？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "text": "就因為是大生意我才打算這麼做，本小姐自然有分寸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠處的叫喊聲",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "有賊！抓賊！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠處的叫喊聲",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "別讓他跑了！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "街頭青年",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_305_1",
      "text": "呃......杜小姐，這也是你安排的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "text": "......當然不是！快跟去看看！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_298_1",
      "text": "您的朋友好像都睡下了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "text": "......時候其實不早了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_298_1",
      "text": "只是閒聊幾句就到這個時辰了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_298_1",
      "text": "......那看戲的事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "text": "再說吧，你應該先養好身體，儘量別出門了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "text": "照顧好自己。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_298_1",
      "text": "總有些比身體抱恙還要緊的事，我才會特地出這趟門的呀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "text": "......看戲嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_298_1",
      "text": "嗯哼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "text": "可我終歸有公務在身，脫不開身。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_298_1",
      "text": "梁大人這是在責備我遊手好閒？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "text": "豈敢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠處的叫喊聲",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "有賊！抓賊！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "text": "唔......賊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_298_1",
      "text": "真稀奇，梁府也能遭賊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "text": "你先進屋去，我去看看怎麼回事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_298_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "text": "什麼情況？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "text": "哦，梁大人，我也剛到......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "text": "......你們是鯉的客人，也就是我的客人。讓你們受驚，實在是有違待客之道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雜役",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_304_1",
      "text": "梁、梁大人，剛才我準備收工回家，突然看到牆上有個人影......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "text": "人影？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雜役",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_304_1",
      "text": "是、是，好像還抱著一隻盒子......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "text": "......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "text": "去鯉的房間，快！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "那位掃雪的姑娘說得沒錯，路確實難走。特別是我辛辛苦苦走上來，反而不見人影了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "喂，你還在嗎——？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "......這裡究竟是哪裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "你要我來這裡做什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "......我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉？",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "......對了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉？",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "我是來......找你敘舊的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉？",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "......不了，沒有懸念，算不得樂趣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉？",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "只是給你帶了件薄禮。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉？",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "幾十年而已，彈指一揮間。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉？",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "黑白一對，如光影相生，陰陽調和。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉？",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "你選一隻吧，另一隻，我便自己留著了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉？",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "怎麼？不喜歡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉？",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "怕，也不怕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉？",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "再說，只是大勢所迫罷了——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "唔......剛才那是......夢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "text": "你沒事吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "我還沒到睡個覺就會出事的年紀......怎麼了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "text": "......鯉先生，剛才有人說看見了小偷，抱著與您那隻相同的匣子飛簷走壁逃了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "text": "匣子不見了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "你說那隻酒盞啊......沒事，在我這呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "text": "你是怎麼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "放匣子裡的是我剛才順手從櫥櫃上順下來的普通茶壺，拿墨水染了個漆黑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "我還沒有傻到明知有人盯上這玩意，還不留個心眼的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "text": "鯉先生真如同克洛絲恩人所說，一顆七竅玲瓏心，絕無紕漏啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "梁大人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "能為了這一隻破古董就招惹一城知府，如果天底下的賊都是這個態度，近衛局只用等在煎餅攤前就好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "這東西到底什麼來歷？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "text": "該告訴你的，我會告訴你的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "text": "這也是我要拜託你的第二件事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "text": "找到它的主人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "......原來如此。確實是個用得著偵探的工作。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "不過在此之前......烏有兄，你的克洛絲恩人呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "text": "呃......難、難道追出去了！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "text": "我去看看！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "text": "（一路追到這裡......但這裡的夜市也太熱鬧了點吧？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "text": "（竟然跟丟了嗎。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "text": "（總之選個方向試探一下......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "text": "啊，抱歉——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "text": "——你是，白天的——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "text": "......是不是我說“不關我事”，也沒用了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "text": "我還什麼都沒說呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "text": "換位思考一下嘛，剛到尚蜀，就碰上有人搶劫自己的朋友，還連搶兩次，說是巧合你信嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "text": "不過我也可以聽你狡辯兩句就是啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "text": "哼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "text": "那就是多說無益了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "我去這邊看看。你往那邊走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "text": "好！勞煩鯉兄了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "慢著，烏有兄。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "text": "怎麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "你......腳邊那是什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "text": "嗯？什麼也沒有啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "......似乎只是我眼花了，大概是什麼寵物吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "我們走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇妙的物件",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_306_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
